WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:01.581
Two Sum, target 9.

00:00:01.581 --> 00:00:03.543
For each number ask: have I

00:00:03.543 --> 00:00:05.256
already seen target minus me?

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:09.430
Store value -> index in a

00:00:09.430 --> 00:00:10.230
hash map.

00:00:10.280 --> 00:00:11.668
Check before you store.

00:00:11.718 --> 00:00:12.843
One pass, O(n) time.

00:00:13.744 --> 00:00:15.147
Understand the pattern, not just the

00:00:15.147 --> 00:00:16.147
code.
